===Etymology 3===
Apparently from {{etyl|nds-nl|no}} or {{etyl|nds-de|no}}.<ref>[http://www.nob-ordbok.uio.no/perl/ordbok.cgi?OPP=puss&begge=+&ordbok=begge]</ref>

New High {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|Possen||coarse prank|lang=de}}, although superficially similar, derives via {{etyl|gmh|-}} from {{etyl|fro|-}}, and is therefore probably unrelated.

